id: supporter
name: Supporter
order: 2
optionOf: spirit-of-namek
optionEffect: 4
description: >
  When a Studied Ally hits an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, you may increase the Wound Roll by 1/2 of your Surgency. If you do, that Ally stops being Studied after they complete this Attacking Maneuver.
text: >
  Supporter [Triggered, 1/Round]: When a Studied Ally hits an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, you may increase the Wound Roll by 1/2 of your Surgency. If you do, that Ally stops being Studied after they complete this Attacking Maneuver.

---

# An Ally you Studied hitting an Opponent: asked of you as their hit is answered, once a Round - half your Surgency on
# their Wound (chat.mjs answerHit).
[passive]
allow refined.supporter;
